  "id": "battle-styles-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Battle Styles Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Sold by shops in the Prerelease Program from 6 March 2021, ahead of the expansion's release on 19 March. Each box held four Battle Styles booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Battle Styles logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Cherrim, Tapu Bulu, Octillery, Crobat and Houndoom, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Sword & Shield's non-holo Professor's Research, first found in that expansion's box.",
